<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <title>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Please wait…</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>لطفاً صبر کنید…</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Attendere prego...</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Proszę czekać...</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Пожалуйста, подождите...</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Lütfen bekleyin...</value>
  </title>
  <title>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Xin vui lòng đợi...</value>
  </title>
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>PictureDecoration</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Decoration picture</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>تصویر تزئینی</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Immagine decorativa</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Dekoracja obrazek</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Декорация картинка</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Dekorasyon resmi</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Trang trí hình vẽ</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>PictureDecorationExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>3</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>PictureDecorationContextMenu</name>
      <id>2</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
    <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:PictureDecorationExtInfo">
      <picture xsi:type="core:PictureRef">
        <picture>CommonPicture.TimeConsumingOperation48</picture>
      </picture>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>TitleDecoration</name>
    <id>4</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Changes in security profile settings are being applied 
in the server cluster.

This may take a long time (within a minute).
Please wait…</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>تغییرات تنظیمات پروفایل امنیتی در حال اعمال 
در کلاستر سرور است.

ممکن است مدتی طول بکشد (حداکثر یک دقیقه).
لطفاً صبر کنید…</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Vengono applicate le modifiche nelle impostazioni dei profili di sicurezza
nel cluster dei server.

 Operazione può richiedere del tempo (entro un minuto).
Attendere prego...</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Stosowane są zmiany w ustawieniach profili bezpieczeństwa
w klastrze serwerów.

Może to zająć dużo czasu (do minuty).
Proszę czekać...</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Применяются изменения в настройках профилей безопасности
в кластере серверов.

Это может занять длительное время (в пределах минуты).
Пожалуйста, подождите...</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Sunucu kümesindeki güvenlik profili 
ayarlarında yapılan değişiklikler uygulanır.

Bu uzun sürebilir (bir dakika içinde).
 Lütfen bekle...</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Đang áp dụng thay đổi trong tùy chỉnh hồ sơ bảo mật
trong cụm Server.

Việc này có thể mất nhiều thời gian (khoảng vài phút).
Xin vui lòng đợi...</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>TitleDecorationExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>6</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>TitleDecorationContextMenu</name>
      <id>5</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>Label</type>
    <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
      <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      <verticalAlign>Center</verticalAlign>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
  <commandBarLocation>None</commandBarLocation>
  <autoCommandBar>
    <name>FormCommandBar</name>
    <id>-1</id>
    <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
    <autoFill>true</autoFill>
  </autoCommandBar>
  <handlers>
    <event>OnOpen</event>
    <name>OnOpen</name>
  </handlers>
  <handlers>
    <event>BeforeClose</event>
    <name>BeforeClose</name>
  </handlers>
  <handlers>
    <event>OnCreateAtServer</event>
    <name>OnCreateAtServer</name>
  </handlers>
  <saveWindowSettings>true</saveWindowSettings>
  <autoUrl>true</autoUrl>
  <group>HorizontalIfPossible</group>
  <autoFillCheck>true</autoFillCheck>
  <allowFormCustomize>true</allowFormCustomize>
  <enabled>true</enabled>
  <showTitle>true</showTitle>
  <showCloseButton>true</showCloseButton>
  <attributes>
    <name>Object</name>
    <id>1</id>
    <valueType>
      <types>DataProcessorObject.ExternalResourcesPermissionsSetup</types>
    </valueType>
    <view>
      <common>true</common>
    </view>
    <edit>
      <common>true</common>
    </edit>
    <main>true</main>
  </attributes>
  <attributes>
    <name>Duration</name>
    <id>2</id>
    <valueType>
      <types>Number</types>
      <numberQualifiers>
        <precision>10</precision>
      </numberQualifiers>
    </valueType>
    <view>
      <common>true</common>
    </view>
    <edit>
      <common>true</common>
    </edit>
  </attributes>
  <attributes>
    <name>JobID</name>
    <id>3</id>
    <valueType>
      <types>UUID</types>
    </valueType>
    <view>
      <common>true</common>
    </view>
    <edit>
      <common>true</common>
    </edit>
  </attributes>
  <attributes>
    <name>CheckIteration</name>
    <id>4</id>
    <valueType>
      <types>Number</types>
      <numberQualifiers>
        <precision>10</precision>
      </numberQualifiers>
    </valueType>
    <view>
      <common>true</common>
    </view>
    <edit>
      <common>true</common>
    </edit>
  </attributes>
  <parameters>
    <name>Duration</name>
    <valueType>
      <types>Number</types>
      <numberQualifiers>
        <precision>10</precision>
      </numberQualifiers>
    </valueType>
  </parameters>
  <parameters>
    <name>StorageAddress</name>
    <valueType>
      <types>String</types>
      <stringQualifiers/>
    </valueType>
  </parameters>
  <parameters>
    <name>RecoveryMode</name>
    <valueType>
      <types>Boolean</types>
    </valueType>
  </parameters>
  <commandInterface>
    <navigationPanel/>
    <commandBar/>
  </commandInterface>
  <extInfo xsi:type="form:ObjectFormExtInfo"/>
</form:Form>
